{"case_id":"live_r3_role_villager_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":6,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是6号，普通村民。昨晚4号倒牌，没有遗言信息；本局又无人上警流警，我们缺少带队和验人信息。今天希望大家依次发言，尽量提供有用线索，不要草率归票；我倾向先从发言找逻辑漏洞，票型先观望。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"role_claim","subject":6,"role":"villager","polarity":"assert","supporting_text":"我是6号，普通村民"}],"forbidden_claims":[],"tags":["role_claim","live_api"],"difficulty":"basic","note":"明确村民身份声明；没有明确投票目标。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_seer_check_vote_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":7,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是7号，预言家。昨晚我查验了1号，结果是狼人（event 2）。我跳出来带队，今天建议出1号。夜间4号倒牌没有遗言，本局流警，更需要神职带队。我请各位先别分票，今天把1号投出去。后续我继续查验，狼人夜里大概率会刀我，我会在遗言里给信息。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"role_claim","subject":7,"role":"seer","polarity":"assert","supporting_text":"我是7号，预言家"},{"kind":"check_claim","target":1,"night":1,"result":"werewolf","supporting_text":"昨晚我查验了1号，结果是狼人"},{"kind":"vote_recommendation","target":1,"conditional":false,"supporting_text":"今天建议出1号"}],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":4}],"tags":["role_claim","check_claim","vote_recommendation","live_api"],"difficulty":"basic","note":"同一归票语义在后文重复，不重复标两条；event 2 只是模型发言文本。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_conditional_vote_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":8,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是8号，一个好人身份。现在7号跳预言家查杀1号，这是目前唯一的硬信息，但毕竟没有对跳、没有警徽验证，不能只听一家之言就急着归票。我建议先听完1号的回应，再看看后面有没有人对跳，以及票型变化。我本人可以先跟7号的查杀方向，但希望大家理性发言，别被带节奏。先表态：倾向出1号，但想先听1号辩解。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"alignment_claim","target":8,"alignment":"good","polarity":"assert","supporting_text":"我是8号，一个好人身份"},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":1,"intent":"vote","conditional":true,"condition":"想先听1号辩解","supporting_text":"倾向出1号，但想先听1号辩解"}],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"role_claim","subject":8,"role":"villager"},{"kind":"check_claim","target":1}],"tags":["alignment_claim","vote_intent","conditional","role_boundary","live_api"],"difficulty":"boundary","note":"好人身份标为good阵营，不等于普通村民；转述7号查杀不能成为8号查验。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_multi_condition_vote_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":9,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是9号。目前7号跳预言家查杀1号，这是今天唯一的硬信息，且暂时没有对跳。8号说得对，应该先听1号自己的辩解。我倾向跟7号这个查杀方向，但希望1号能给出合理的解释，也看看后面还有没有人跳出来对跳。如果1号辩解无力，今天出1号我认可；若出现对跳，我们再重新梳理。先表态：倾向出1号，但等1号发言后再定票。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"vote_intent","target":1,"intent":"vote","conditional":true,"condition":"如果1号辩解无力","supporting_text":"如果1号辩解无力，今天出1号我认可"}],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":1}],"tags":["vote_intent","conditional","reported_check","live_api"],"difficulty":"boundary","note":"存在两种相近条件表达，暂以最明确的一句作为唯一 Gold，待共同审核。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_no_claim_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3","note":"安全降级发言"},"speaker":1,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"1号本轮暂时没有新增信息，继续听取其他玩家发言。","expected_claims":[],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"role_claim","subject":1},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":7}],"tags":["no_claim","fallback_text","live_api"],"difficulty":"basic","note":"纯负例，不应提取身份、查验、站边或投票。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_inherited_target_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":2,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是2号。先说一点：7号跳预言家查杀1号，目前没有对跳，但这不代表可以直接归票。第一，本局无人上警流警，7号没有任何警徽验证，单凭一句首验就号票，信息量其实很单薄；第二，1号发言简短，可第一天本来就有很多玩家没信息，拿“话少”当狼点站不住脚；第三，如果7号真是狼跳预言家，把刀口引到1号身上就是典型的白天扛推路线。我建议先别急着定票，听完3号、5号以及后面的发言，看看有没有人对跳、有没有更可信的信息，再决定今天出谁。我不接受仅凭7号一家之言就送1号出局。","expected_claims":[],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":1},{"kind":"vote_recommendation","target":1},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":1}],"tags":["cross_sentence","reported_check","ambiguous_vote","must_not_extract","live_api"],"difficulty":"adversarial","note":"真实失败样本：不能从前文继承1号作为“再决定出谁”的目标。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_follow_this_vote_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":3,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是3号。目前7号跳预言家查杀1号，确实是今天唯一的信息，但我认为不能直接送1号出局。理由和2号类似：本局流警，7号没有任何验人背书，首验就精准查杀，也可能是狼队悍跳的扛推路线。另外1号发言虽短，但第一天信息本来就少，话少不构成狼点。我更想听听5号的发言和后续票型，如果有人对跳或7号逻辑有漏洞再定。今天我不会轻易跟这一票，建议大家都冷静表态，别被一家之言带节奏。","expected_claims":[],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":1},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":1},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":7}],"tags":["reported_check","ambiguous_vote","must_not_extract","live_api"],"difficulty":"adversarial","note":"真实失败样本：“这一票”没有显式目标，不生成投票 Claim。"}
{"case_id":"live_r3_explicit_conditional_accept_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-3"},"speaker":5,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是5号，普通村民。目前7号跳预言家查杀1号，这是全场唯一的硬信息，而且到现在没有对跳。但我认同2号和3号的谨慎：本局流警，7号没有警徽验证，单凭首验就归票确实信息单薄；同时1号没有有效自辩，也不能完全排除狼队悍跳扛推。我的立场是：暂时不急着定票，先记下7号这个查杀方向，等看有没有人对跳以及最终票型。如果到最后仍无对跳，出1号我可以接受；若有人对跳，必须重新梳理。我建议大家都表态清楚，别被带节奏，也别轻易分票。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"role_claim","subject":5,"role":"villager","polarity":"assert","supporting_text":"我是5号，普通村民"},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":1,"intent":"vote","conditional":true,"condition":"如果到最后仍无对跳","supporting_text":"如果到最后仍无对跳，出1号我可以接受"}],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":1}],"tags":["role_claim","vote_intent","conditional","live_api"],"difficulty":"boundary","note":"“可以接受出1号”是否算本人投票意图需要共同确认。"}
{"case_id":"live_r2_counterclaim_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-2"},"speaker":1,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是1号。7号跳预言家查杀我，我在这里对跳：我才是真预言家，昨夜查验的正是7号，结果是狼人。7号抢在我前面起跳，反手给我发查杀，这是狼队典型的悍跳先手套路——我才是真预言家，今天该出的不是1，而是7。请后置位2、3、5仔细听，如果后面还有人对跳我们再对比查验和逻辑；但我这里信息很明确：7是悍跳狼。请好人跟我一起出7，不要被假预言家带节奏。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"role_claim","subject":1,"role":"seer","polarity":"assert","supporting_text":"我才是真预言家"},{"kind":"check_claim","target":7,"night":1,"result":"werewolf","supporting_text":"昨夜查验的正是7号，结果是狼人"},{"kind":"alignment_claim","target":7,"alignment":"werewolf","polarity":"assert","supporting_text":"7是悍跳狼"},{"kind":"vote_recommendation","target":7,"conditional":false,"supporting_text":"请好人跟我一起出7"}],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":1}],"tags":["counterclaim","role_claim","check_claim","alignment_claim","vote_recommendation","live_api"],"difficulty":"boundary","note":"对跳场景；7号对1号的查杀是转述，不能成为1号自己的查验。"}
{"case_id":"live_r2_trust_and_vote_001","review_status":"draft","source":{"source_type":"live_api","game_id":"m2-hybrid-flash-day-1","run_id":"2026-08-07-run-2"},"speaker":2,"day":1,"speech_context":"day_speech","text":"我是2号。目前场上7号与1号对跳预言家：7号先手查杀1号，1号后手反查杀7号。我认为1号的起跳更合理——7号抢先起跳、第一时间给查杀，更像狼队悍跳先手抢节奏；而1号是被动对跳，给出的查验信息明确且直接反打7号。两人查验互验，逻辑上必出一狼，我倾向信1号出7。请大家对比两人的发言动机：7号在无人对跳前急着归票1号，而1号在被查杀后冷静反打，我更信1号是真预言家。后置位3号和5号请补充视角，今天建议归票7号。","expected_claims":[{"kind":"stance_claim","target":1,"stance":"trust","supporting_text":"我更信1号是真预言家"},{"kind":"vote_intent","target":7,"intent":"vote","conditional":false,"supporting_text":"我倾向信1号出7"},{"kind":"vote_recommendation","target":7,"conditional":false,"supporting_text":"今天建议归票7号"}],"forbidden_claims":[{"kind":"check_claim","target":1},{"kind":"check_claim","target":7}],"tags":["reported_check","stance_claim","vote_intent","vote_recommendation","live_api"],"difficulty":"boundary","note":"两条查杀均为转述；本人只表达信任、投票方向和归票建议。"}
